extends Node3D
## Skinned cartoon character built from the Blender kit
## (assets/characters/character_kit.glb, generated by
## tools/blender/build_characters.py).
##
## One shared skeleton; every clothing piece, hair style, beard, hat and
## accessory is its own skinned mesh, so a "look" just picks pieces and
## colors. Bones are posed procedurally (walk, idle, aim, smoke, ...).
##
## Faces -Z (Godot forward). Feet at y=0.
##
##   var c = Character.new(); add_child(c); c.build(Character.preset("cop"))
##   c.pose = "aim"; c.move_speed = 3.0

